---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for The Lunan — how data is handled and what is collected."
>
  <main class="pt-[64px]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[760px] px-4 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24">
      <!-- Pill badge -->
      <span
        class="font-manrope mb-6 inline-block rounded-full bg-[#ebf3ed] px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[3px] text-[#386547] uppercase"
      >
        Privacy
      </span>

      <!-- Heading -->
      <h1
        class="font-space-grotesk text-[38px] leading-[1.05] font-bold tracking-[-0.04em] text-[#29302d] sm:text-[46px] md:text-[52px]"
      >
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>

      <!-- Divider -->
      <div class="my-6 h-[2px] w-10 rounded-full bg-[#c5f7d0]"></div>

      <!-- Last updated -->
      <p class="font-manrope mb-10 text-[13px] text-[rgba(41,48,45,0.4)]">
        Last updated: April 2026
      </p>

      <!-- Body -->
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <section>
          <h2
            class="font-space-grotesk mt-4 mb-3 text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#29302d]"
          >
            The short version
          </h2>
          <p
            class="font-manrope text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-[rgba(41,48,45,0.65)]"
          >
            This is a personal blog. I&apos;m not trying to harvest your data. I
            don&apos;t run ads, I don&apos;t sell anything, and I have no
            interest in tracking you around the internet.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            class="font-space-grotesk mt-4 mb-3 text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#29302d]"
          >
            What this site collects
          </h2>
          <p
            class="font-manrope text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-[rgba(41,48,45,0.65)]"
          >
            The Lunan is a static site. It does not use cookies, does not
            require an account, and does not collect personally identifiable
            information by default. Comments on posts are anonymous &mdash; no
            name, no email, nothing tied to you.
          </p>
          <p
            class="font-manrope mt-4 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-[rgba(41,48,45,0.65)]"
          >
            Basic server logs (IP address, browser, page visited) may be
            retained by the hosting provider for operational purposes. I
            don&apos;t access these unless something breaks.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            class="font-space-grotesk mt-4 mb-3 text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#29302d]"
          >
            Third-party services
          </h2>
          <p
            class="font-manrope text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-[rgba(41,48,45,0.65)]"
          >
            This site loads fonts from Google Fonts. Google may log that
            request. If that concerns you, most browsers let you block external
            font loading. Share buttons (Facebook, X) open external sites in a
            new tab &mdash; those sites have their own privacy policies.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            class="font-space-grotesk mt-4 mb-3 text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#29302d]"
          >
            Local storage
          </h2>
          <p
            class="font-manrope text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-[rgba(41,48,45,0.65)]"
          >
            The clap feature saves your interaction (clapped or not, local
            count) to your browser&apos;s local storage. This data stays on your
            device and is never sent anywhere.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            class="font-space-grotesk mt-4 mb-3 text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#29302d]"
          >
            Questions
          </h2>
          <p
            class="font-manrope text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-[rgba(41,48,45,0.65)]"
          >
            If you have questions about any of this, leave a comment on any post
            or reach out through the links in the about page. I&apos;ll do my
            best to respond.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer nav -->
      <div class="mt-14 border-t border-[rgba(197,247,208,0.4)] pt-8">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="font-manrope group inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[rgba(41,48,45,0.5)] transition-colors hover:text-[#386547]"
        >
          <svg
            width="14"
            height="14"
            viewBox="0 0 14 14"
            fill="none"
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5"
          >
            <path
              d="M13 7H1M6 2L1 7l5 5"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
          </svg>
          Back home
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
